# Public surfaces (isiro)

Customer docs, README, benchmark scripts, and generated reports. No research or codec lineage. No dest-from-live recipe.

## Do not write

`tANS`, `rANS`, `signfold`, `percol`, `dest_gib`, `dest-from-live`, `continue_ok`, `leftover` (as a product term), `working-set` (as a dest formula)

## Prefer

KV cache, the heatmap, Graph ON, `gpu_memory_utilization=0.90`

Publish measured KV GiB. Do not publish last-W × seqs + slack or bytes-per-token-from-live-specs.
